  "conclusion": "NORESUS primarily reduces the presentation problem through a static raster map, sparse fixed-size sprite overlays, a small independent minimap, and 639 coarse strategic regions. Gates should retain Earth3 polygon authority while benchmarking a cached/tiled raster presentation layer, batched original icon atlas, sparse dynamic overlays, and label/layer LOD. Backend snapshot latency is a separate #207 problem."
